## Interface: 16001
## Title: Player Blacklist
## Notes: Player blacklists for the open world (PvP) and dungeons/raids. Icons and alerts when you see them or group with them. /ln
## Notes-esES: Listas negras de jugadores: mundo abierto (PvP) y mazmorras/bandas. Iconos y avisos al verlos o agruparte con ellos. /ln
